{"version": 2, "width": 80, "height": 24, "timestamp": 1794495026, "idle_time_limit": 2.0, "env": {"SHELL": null, "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "AgentGuard CLI demo (NEAR testnet)"}
[0.2992, "o", "\r\n========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.300944, "o", "AgentGuard — CLI demo (NEAR testnet)\r\n========================================================================\r\nContract : guard.agentguard-adt.testnet\r\nExplorer : https://explorer.testnet.near.org/accounts/guard.agentguard-adt.testnet\r\nRPC      : https://rpc.testnet.near.org\r\n"]
[0.301778, "o", "Agent    : agent.agentguard-adt.testnet  (key from $NEAR_KEY_FILE)\r\nOwner    : agentguard-adt.testnet (key from $NEAR_OWNER_KEY_FILE)\r\n"]
[0.301879, "o", "Shop     : shop.agentguard-adt.testnet\r\n"]
[0.339021, "o", "\r\n========================================================================\r\n(a) Policy + status — what the vault allows\r\n========================================================================\r\n"]
[7.255315, "o", "\r\n  Policy (get_policy):\r\n"]
[7.255758, "o", "    max_per_tx   : 1 NEAR\r\n"]
[7.25589, "o", "    daily_limit  : 5 NEAR\r\n    allowlist    : [\"shop.agentguard-adt.testnet\",\"agentguard-adt.testnet\"]\r\n"]
[7.255912, "o", "    paused       : false\r\n\r\n  Status (get_status):\r\n    owner        : agentguard-adt.testnet\r\n"]
[7.255947, "o", "    agent        : agent.agentguard-adt.testnet\r\n    vault balance: 5.4982 NEAR\r\n"]
[7.25598, "o", "    paused       : false\r\n"]
[7.256043, "o", "    spent_today  : 0.5 NEAR (day 20769)\r\n    remaining    : 4.5 NEAR\r\n"]
[7.256109, "o", "\r\n========================================================================\r\n"]
[7.25614, "o", "(b) Agent tries 5 NEAR to a stranger — expect BLOCKED\r\n========================================================================\r\n  A compromised / prompt-injected agent tries to drain the vault to an\r\n  address that is not on the allowlist: stranger.testnet\r\n"]
[7.256166, "o", "  (The contract checks the per-tx cap before the allowlist, so the\r\n  reason will be \"over_max_per_tx\" — the stranger fails both checks.)\r\n"]
[7.256666, "o", "\r\n  Agent calls spend(receiver=\"stranger.testnet\", amount=5 NEAR) ...\r\n"]
[15.898317, "o", "  -> BLOCKED ⛔  reason: \"over_max_per_tx\"\r\n     tx: https://explorer.testnet.near.org/transactions/BjsNoR8yWpaGuqBtgiE1CEzHCntC2dchMt3VEZBVpoHH\r\n"]
[16.398543, "o", "\r\n========================================================================\r\n(b2) Agent tries 0.5 NEAR to a stranger — expect BLOCKED (allowlist)\r\n========================================================================\r\n  Under the per-tx cap this time, so the allowlist is what stops it:\r\n  reason should be \"receiver_not_allowlisted\".\r\n"]
[16.398812, "o", "\r\n  Agent calls spend(receiver=\"stranger.testnet\", amount=0.5 NEAR) ...\r\n"]
[24.365621, "o", "  -> BLOCKED ⛔  reason: \"receiver_not_allowlisted\"\r\n     tx: https://explorer.testnet.near.org/transactions/7SPoQwuTjLz1DgNoMSD7U5AK2XzsLTbyxtbDRn4daPtT\r\n"]
[24.866306, "o", "\r\n========================================================================\r\n(c) Agent tries 2 NEAR to the shop — expect BLOCKED (over max_per_tx)\r\n========================================================================\r\n  shop.agentguard-adt.testnet IS allowlisted, but 2 NEAR exceeds max_per_tx (1 NEAR).\r\n\r\n  Agent calls spend(receiver=\"shop.agentguard-adt.testnet\", amount=2 NEAR) ...\r\n"]
[32.853751, "o", "  -> BLOCKED ⛔  reason: \"over_max_per_tx\"\r\n     tx: https://explorer.testnet.near.org/transactions/7gzQrRJ2kGVguPwAUzfKiX9bQjzPDBCYzAqNb4DYYiEA\r\n"]
[33.354097, "o", "\r\n========================================================================\r\n(d) Agent pays 0.5 NEAR to the shop — expect ALLOWED\r\n========================================================================\r\n  Within policy: allowlisted receiver, under max_per_tx, under daily limit.\r\n\r\n  Agent calls spend(receiver=\"shop.agentguard-adt.testnet\", amount=0.5 NEAR) ...\r\n"]
[41.903595, "o", "  -> ALLOWED ✅  reason: \"allowed\"\r\n     tx: https://explorer.testnet.near.org/transactions/HtpxjdAw8Ss3yoxnwrRP64gEVq7pbX3ghGAMetVXyyWh\r\n\r\n  ✅ Payment landed. Verify on the explorer: https://explorer.testnet.near.org/transactions/HtpxjdAw8Ss3yoxnwrRP64gEVq7pbX3ghGAMetVXyyWh\r\n"]
[42.403616, "o", "\r\n========================================================================\r\n(e) Owner kill-switch: pause -> blocked, unpause -> allowed again\r\n========================================================================\r\n"]
[42.404751, "o", "\r\n  Owner (agentguard-adt.testnet) pauses the vault ...\r\n"]
[51.313617, "o", "  -> paused via pause()  tx: https://explorer.testnet.near.org/transactions/D4UKbnsiTKDdkFKawQ8a5tUrWREA7ZfaeKpfqbgMs78Y\r\n"]
[55.311274, "o", "  get_status.paused = true\r\n\r\n  Agent tries to pay 0.5 NEAR while paused — expect BLOCKED (\"paused\"):\r\n\r\n  Agent calls spend(receiver=\"shop.agentguard-adt.testnet\", amount=0.5 NEAR) ...\r\n"]
[63.731305, "o", "  -> BLOCKED ⛔  reason: \"paused\"\r\n     tx: https://explorer.testnet.near.org/transactions/4fPUYsJ7wiC76idEFS9be58MQvUNff2d9C64NHo77mtC\r\n"]
[63.73157, "o", "\r\n  Owner unpauses the vault ...\r\n"]
[72.391202, "o", "  -> unpaused via unpause()  tx: https://explorer.testnet.near.org/transactions/3BNp2fHcJtYeBn3vSqYVJUruD43NqfsqWgwyKj2RECQE\r\n"]
[76.396546, "o", "  get_status.paused = false\r\n\r\n  Agent pays 0.5 NEAR again — expect ALLOWED:\r\n\r\n  Agent calls spend(receiver=\"shop.agentguard-adt.testnet\", amount=0.5 NEAR) ...\r\n"]
[84.992728, "o", "  -> ALLOWED ✅  reason: \"allowed\"\r\n     tx: https://explorer.testnet.near.org/transactions/GLh25LBBCCMyGUuVLtxBswn35zisbbRTjkQ8WNWrQYdD\r\n\r\n========================================================================\r\n(f) Decision log — every attempt is on-chain (get_log)\r\n========================================================================\r\n"]
[88.248421, "o", "  ALLOWED ✅  0.5 NEAR -> shop.agentguard-adt.testnet  | allowed  | day 20769 | 2026-11-12T14:51:50.563Z\r\n  BLOCKED ⛔  0.5 NEAR -> shop.agentguard-adt.testnet  | paused  | day 20769 | 2026-11-12T14:51:30.043Z\r\n"]
[88.248651, "o", "  ALLOWED ✅  0.5 NEAR -> shop.agentguard-adt.testnet  | allowed  | day 20769 | 2026-11-12T14:51:07.556Z\r\n  BLOCKED ⛔  2 NEAR -> shop.agentguard-adt.testnet  | over_max_per_tx  | day 20769 | 2026-11-12T14:50:59.015Z\r\n  BLOCKED ⛔  0.5 NEAR -> stranger.testnet  | receiver_not_allowlisted  | day 20769 | 2026-11-12T14:50:50.856Z\r\n  BLOCKED ⛔  5 NEAR -> stranger.testnet  | over_max_per_tx  | day 20769 | 2026-11-12T14:50:42.317Z\r\n  BLOCKED ⛔  2 NEAR -> shop.agentguard-adt.testnet  | over_max_per_tx  | day 20769 | 2026-11-12T14:49:08.191Z\r\n  ALLOWED ✅  0.5 NEAR -> shop.agentguard-adt.testnet  | allowed  | day 20769 | 2026-11-12T14:48:47.046Z\r\n\r\n========================================================================\r\nSummary\r\n========================================================================\r\n"]
[88.251839, "o", "┌─────────┬────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────┬───────────┬────────────────────────────┬────────┐\r\n│ (index) │ Step   │ Action                                    │ Expected  │ Got       │ Reason / note              │ OK     │\r\n├─────────┼────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────┼───────────┼────────────────────────────┼────────┤\r\n│ 0       │ \u001b[32m'(b)'\u001b[39m  │ \u001b[32m'5 NEAR -> stranger.testnet'\u001b[39m              │ \u001b[32m'BLOCKED'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'BLOCKED'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'over_max_per_tx'\u001b[39m          │ \u001b[32m'PASS'\u001b[39m │\r\n│ 1       │ \u001b[32m'(b2)'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'0.5 NEAR -> stranger.testnet'\u001b[39m            │ \u001b[32m'BLOCKED'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'BLOCKED'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'receiver_not_allowlisted'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'PASS'\u001b[39m │\r\n│ 2       │ \u001b[32m'(c)'\u001b[39m  │ \u001b[32m'2 NEAR -> shop.agentguard-adt.testnet'\u001b[39m   │ \u001b[32m'BLOCKED'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'BLOCKED'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'over_max_per_tx'\u001b[39m          │ \u001b[32m'PASS'\u001b[39m │\r\n│ 3       │ \u001b[32m'(d)'\u001b[39m  │ \u001b[32m'0.5 NEAR -> shop.agentguard-adt.testnet'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'ALLOWED'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'ALLOWED'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'allowed'\u001b[39m                  │ \u001b[32m'PASS'\u001b[39m │\r\n│ 4       │ \u001b[32m'(e1)'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'0.5 NEAR -> shop.agentguard-adt.testnet'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'BLOCKED'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'BLOCKED'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'paused'\u001b[39m                   │ \u001b[32m'PASS'\u001b[39m │\r\n│ 5       │ \u001b[32m'(e2)'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'0.5 NEAR -> shop.agentguard-adt.testnet'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'ALLOWED'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'ALLOWED'\u001b[39m │ \u001b[32m'allowed'\u001b[39m                  │ \u001b[32m'PASS'\u001b[39m │\r\n└─────────┴────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────┴───────────┴────────────────────────────┴────────┘\r\n"]
[88.252136, "o", "\r\nVault: https://explorer.testnet.near.org/accounts/guard.agentguard-adt.testnet\r\nDemo result: all steps behaved as expected. ✅\r\n"]
